   "title": "Powder watch at the UK's favourite Alpine resorts: up to 121 cm of new snow by 23 November",
   "description": "Snow at the UK's favourite Alpine resorts on 20 November: snow depth on the upper slopes, fresh snow, the next three days and the pick for a short trip.",
   "lede": "12 of the 12 resorts we follow at the UK's favourite Alpine resorts have snow on their upper slopes on Friday 20 November; Les Arcs leads with 166 cm.",
   "sections": [
    {
     "h": "The next three days",
